    "body": "## Summary\n\n`docs/package.json` lists `dayjs` as a development dependency, but the docs code does not import or reference it. It was added when the docs were brought into this repository in #10649, and I could not find any use of it in the repository history since then.\n\n## Proposed change\n\nPlease remove `dayjs` from `docs/package.json` and its entry in `docs/package-lock.json`. This should have no effect on the public API or runtime behavior.\n\nThe contribution guidelines reserve dependency-only PRs for maintainers and approved bots, so I am opening an issue instead of a PR.",
